WEBVTT

00:08:29.878 --> 00:08:31.822
Political leaders and the public

00:08:31.822 --> 00:08:33.564
must care to solve a problem;

00:08:33.564 --> 00:08:36.735
institutions must support its solution;

00:08:36.735 --> 00:08:39.810
It must really be a technological problem;

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:43.661
and we must understand it.

00:08:43.661 --> 00:08:45.108
The Apollo mission,

00:08:45.108 --> 00:08:47.845
which has become a kind of metaphor

00:08:47.845 --> 00:08:51.029
for technology's capacity to solve big problems,

00:08:51.029 --> 00:08:53.240
met these criteria.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:56.667
But it is an irreproducible model for the future.

00:08:56.667 --> 00:08:58.491
It is not 1961.

00:08:58.491 --> 00:09:02.582
There is no galvanizing contest like the Cold War,